==English==

===Verb===
{{en-verb|ing=[[take]] [[care]]|takes care|taking care|took care|taken care}}

# {{intransitive}} To be [[cautious]], [[careful]] or [[prudent]].
# {{intransitive}} To [[mind]], or be [[in charge]] of something.

